Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] FieldState clear stops before defaultStart; NULL slots

HEAP.zero(&FIELDSTG_state, 100) is the PS1 prefix, offsetof(defaultStart).
On LP64 that prefix is larger, but defaultStart and defaultStartDir still
sit in front of the method pointers and must survive pickStage: leaveField
stores the door spawn there. Zeroing through offsetof(init) wiped it, so the
next room spawned the player at (0, 0).
WSTAG780 (and other stages) leave FieldState.slots NULL; FIELDSTG_createTriggers
already guards, but FIELDSTG_requestSlotFiles did not and SEGV'd on host.

